ri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622334_1541820534344452_4605951012105867404_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ccCwMlRRnkIQ7kNvwGhtrF1&_nc_oc=AdoOPr1lRPcWCPPmqRJZ-4PMbBCvr-keCoOGHuaxSql7CZbQ-tNhHqHCGbehcXiEr4Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGYjpfGTnCXSFH1M5EkAb-cD2kLOwvhlzoXeU_v8lxh_A&oe=6A79C05A"}, {"file_name": "06_Blade_Clash_Sparks.png", "id": "1331849842497143", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622285_1331849845830476_6883584088752693671_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W9rwJdoN4jYQ7kNvwEd6bBt&_nc_oc=AdpuTSxUulYe6y4ieKWPy0ythTd4Z_Qeah-d4upTrvbJCX2aqN2QkULUGkAkZ8FzLOQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEkLJKDTHAePJiGrH5dR-dd88DTFWBcZkcUec5LBmygvQ&oe=6A79C34E"}, {"file_name": "04_Two_Enemy_Arena.png", "id": "1474459264450112", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620860_1474459267783445_4825951152730614903_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sP48f41A4EAQ7kNvwFBHxxC&_nc_oc=Ado-qccP6yCZ_UD60gETP99U9titGSAxnN2KbW4BK763qCDwF9wF_c-GY3rQYWHEiUA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEqnvnvgXuZsmdiBXxu6w3td-hn5pnH2vkQ-KZYWuAI1g&oe=6A79B947"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "NinjaSlashVR_Universal_Basic_Asset_2560x1440.png", "id": "1287518843259033", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622334_1287518846592366_3814848564270201524_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gfsfglMGj7EQ7kNvwFNvZ9x&_nc_oc=Adq1ljSbh3QIlO4jc-HuUjcf7_V1ReAl6hbguDDPvMD6hpg3IEvUthQXDzR9Qw-RiRA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGfM9pDcz680yBw_6kz9ZSm5P_hxKlfk4tYE5KCbh1ICQ&oe=6A79CAF4"}, "display_name": "Ninja Slash VR Demo", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Become the blade in Ninja Slash VR, a physics-driven action game built around fast, skill-based sword combat.**\n\n**MASTER PHYSICS-DRIVEN SWORD COMBAT**\n\nSwing, block, stab, and parry using natural VR movements. Your speed, angle, timing, and attack direction determine the result of every clash.\n\n{26040648548967048}\n\n**PERFORM PRECISE PARRIES**\n\nBlocking alone is not enough. Match the direction of an incoming strike and counter it with force to stagger your opponent and create an opening.\n\n{1560641895763836}\n\n\n**SLICE ENEMIES APART**\nTarget specific body parts and armor sections with location-based damage and physical dismemberment. \n\n{1592057919282850}\n\n**MOVE LIKE A CYBER NINJA**\n\nRun, climb, grapple, jump, and use vertical environments to control the battlefield. Close the distance quickly or escape before enemies can surround you.\n{1000893849242001}\n\n\n**CONTROL TIME**\n\nActivate Bullet Time during critical moments to slow enemy attacks and sharpen your reactions. Dodge projectiles, analyze threats, reposition your blade, and perform precise multi-hit combinations while the world moves in slow motion.\n\n{4361927100737258}\n\nEvery block is physical. Every parry requires timing. Every cut is determined by your own movement.\n\n**Draw your blade. Slow down time. Survive the arena. Become the cyber ninja they were built to fear.**", "short_description": "Become a cyber ninja in a physics-driven VR action game. Master the blade, parry deadly attacks, slice through enemies, and fight your way across a futuristic battlefield.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ddbug.github.io/ninja-slash-vr-demo/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Penguin Drawn Studio", "support_website_url": "https://github.com/ddbug/ninja-slash-vr-demo/issues", "website_url": "https://ddbug.github.io/ninja-slash-vr-demo/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "4597815049684